40
00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:25.577
In April, Phnom Penh is boiling hot, with lots of sunshine. In the rainy season, a big rain cloud brings a thunderstorm. Once, little hailstones fell from the sky! In the mountains, the morning is chilly and there is mist. In Japan in winter, it is freezing.

